{"name":"Namibia","hex":"#7c6d61","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Namibia","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A country in Southern Africa. Official name: Republic of Namibia. Capital: Windhoek."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Namibia"}],"entries":[{"title":"Namibia","blocks":[{"text":"Namibia, officially the Republic of Namibia, is a country in Southern Africa. It borders the Atlantic Ocean to the west, Zambia and Angola to the north, Botswana to the east, and South Africa to the south; in the northeast, approximating a quadripoint, Zimbabwe lies less than 200 metres (660 ft) away along the Zambezi river near Kazungula, Zambia. Namibia's capital and largest city is Windhoek."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Flag_of_Namibia.svg/330px-Flag_of_Namibia.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Namibia","wikidata":"Q1030"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Witbooi_Hendrik.jpg/250px-Witbooi_Hendrik.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/Witbooi_Hendrik.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Witbooi_Hendrik.jpg/250px-Witbooi_Hendrik.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWitbooi_Hendrik.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/SamuelMaharero.jpg/500px-SamuelMaharero.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/SamuelMaharero.jpg/1280px-SamuelMaharero.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikime